#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2122
msgid "Kaplan Meier Estimates Tool"
msgstr "Verktyget Kaplan-Meier-estimat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2128
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-dialog\"/> contains the fields specifying the "
"data to be used for the Kaplan Meier Estimates. The time column contains the"
" times or dates at which the subjects died or were censored. If any of the "
"subjects were censored, the <guilabel>Permit censorship</guilabel> checkbox "
"is checked and the Censor column contained the censorship marks. Censorship "
"marks are typically 0s or 1s. The range of censor marks or labels can be set"
" using the remaining two spinboxes."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref linkend=\"kaplan-"
"meier-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fälten där du anger data för Kaplan-Meier-"
"estimaten. Tidskolumnen innehåller tidpunkterna eller datumen då individerna"
" avled eller censurerades. Om någon individ censurerades är kryssrutan "
"<guilabel>Tillåt censur</guilabel> markerad och censurmarkeringarna finns i "
"censurkolumnen. Censurmarkeringar är vanligtvis 0 eller 1. Intervallet för "
"censurmarkeringar eller etiketter ställs in med de två återstående "
"snurrknapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2140
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2142
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
".Kaplan-Meier tool dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan för Kaplan-"
"Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2156
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Groups</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2158
msgid ""
"If the subjects belong to several groups and the groups are supposed to be "
"analyzed separately, the groups tab can be used."
msgstr ""
"Om individerna tillhör flera grupper som ska analyseras var för sig kan du "
"använda fliken Grupper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2164
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog Groups Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Grupper i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2166
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-groups.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"Kaplan-Meier tool dialog groups tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-groups.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken Grupper i "
"dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2178
msgid ""
"The groups tab can be enabled via the <guilabel>Define multiple groups "
"</guilabel> checkbox. The groups column entry contains the address of the "
"column specifying the group membership. Groups can then be defined or "
"deleted via the <guilabel>Add</guilabel> and <guilabel>Remove </guilabel> "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"Du aktiverar fliken Grupper genom att markera <guilabel>Definiera multipla "
"grupper </guilabel>. Fältet för gruppkolumn innehåller adressen till "
"kolumnen som anger grupptillhörighet. Sedan kan du definiera eller ta bort "
"grupper med knapparna <guilabel>Lägg till</guilabel> och <guilabel>Ta bort "
"</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2189
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Options</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2191
msgid ""
"The options tab of the Kaplan-Meier tools dialog is used to set various "
"options of the Kaplan-Meier tool."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Alternativ i Kaplan-Meier-verktygets dialogruta ställer du in "
"olika alternativ för verktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2196
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog Options Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Alternativ i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2198
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the Kaplan-Meier tool dialog options tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken "
"Alternativ i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2221
msgid "A Kaplan-Meier Example"
msgstr "Exempel på Kaplan-Meier-estimat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2224
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Example Input"
msgstr "Indata i Kaplan-Meier-exemplet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2226
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the input "
"to the Kaplan-Meier estimate example and of the input tab of the Kaplan-"
"Meier analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Indata till exemplet "
"med Kaplan-Meier-estimat och fliken Indata i Kaplan-Meier-"
"verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2241
msgid "Using the Kaplan-Meier Tool"
msgstr "Använda Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2242
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to calculate Kaplan-Meier Estimates for the as given in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Each row contains the data "
"for one subject. Column A contains the survival time, i.e. the time until "
"death or censure. Column B contains the group number, we are considering two"
" groups of subjects. Column C indicates whether the subject died (0) or was "
"censured (1)."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill beräkna Kaplan-Meier-estimat för data i <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Varje rad innehåller data för en "
"individ. Kolumn A innehåller överlevnadstiden, det vill säga tiden fram till"
" dödsfall eller censurering. Kolumn B innehåller gruppnumret; här behandlas "
"två grupper. Kolumn C anger om individen avled (0) eller censurerades (1)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2250
msgid ""
"We complete the fields of the <guilabel>Input</guilabel> tab as shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. The time column is A2:A21 "
"and the censure column is C2:C21."
msgstr ""
"Fyll i fälten på fliken <guilabel>Indata</guilabel> enligt <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Tidskolumnen är A2:A21 och "
"censurkolumnen C2:C21."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2260
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Example Group Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Grupper i Kaplan-Meier-exemplet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2262
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the group "
"tab of the Kaplan-Meier analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken Grupper i "
"Kaplan-Meier-analysverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2255
msgid ""
"Since we have two groups of subjects, on the <guilabel>Groups</guilabel> tab"
" we check the <guilabel>Define multiple groups</guilabel> check box and set "
"up two groups with identifiers 1 and 2 in column B2:B21: <_:figure-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Eftersom individerna tillhör två grupper markerar vi <guilabel>Definiera "
"multipla grupper</guilabel> på fliken <guilabel>Grupper</guilabel> och "
"skapar två grupper med identifierarna 1 och 2 i kolumn B2:B21: <_:figure-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2275
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Options</guilabel> tab all checkboxes are pre-checked and "
"we leave them that way to obtain a maximum amount of information."
msgstr ""
"Alla kryssrutor på fliken <guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel> är redan "
"markerade. Vi låter dem vara markerade för att få så mycket information som "
"möjligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2278
msgid ""
"On the output tab we choose where we would like the output to be placed. For"
" the purposes of this example we retain the <guilabel>New Sheet</guilabel> "
"target. After clicking <guilabel>OK</guilabel> we get the output shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-2\"/>. Note that the graph "
"initially always appears on top of the numerical result and was moved for "
"the screen shot."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Utdata väljer vi var resultatet ska placeras. I det här exemplet "
"behåller vi målet <guilabel>Nytt blad</guilabel>. När vi klickar på "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel> visas resultatet i <xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-"
"tool-example-2\"/>. Diagrammet placeras först ovanpå sifferresultatet; i "
"skärmbilden har det flyttats."
